    <string name="green_help_title">Growing The Green</string>
    <string name="green_help_body">Soft Flow creates Drops using the same earning rules as before. Use your Drops to choose a seed and plant a Level 1 specimen. One watering advances exactly one level.\n\nVisible growth arrives at Levels 1, 15, 30, 45, 60, 75 and 90. Level 90 is Fully Grown. At Level 99, your plant earns Mastery and keeps its adult form.\n\nEvery environment and species is available to browse from the beginning. You can plant multiple copies; each grows independently. There are no random outcomes, waiting timers, daily limits or missed-watering penalties.\n\nPlant every species to earn Catalogue badges. Fully grow them for Flourish, and reach Level 99 for Mastery. Earned badges stay yours.\n\nFind your individual plants in The Chest and all growth, care and collection badges in Badges.</string>
